WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
Hi, I'm Erik Voss, and finally we have a
Star Wars Last Jedi trailer! Nothing in

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:08.550
this world can revert me back to a
widdle boy like Star Wars can. Not even

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:12.450
director Rian Johnson's initial warnings
to avoid watching the trailer could keep

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:16.350
me away. Clean? I don't wanna be clean!
By the way, he totally changed his mind

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:20.490
and give us the all-clear, so we good. There are a ton of new details from this

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:23.660
trailer, many of them super missable, and
I don't think everything is what it

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:27.160
seems to be here. So I'm gonna break it
all down, and if any of my speculation

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:31.680
and guesswork ends up being accurate -
possible spoilers ahead. Let's get started.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:45.320
'When I found you... I saw... raw, untamed power!"

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:49.200
Okay, so with John Williams'
classic orchestral harp, we open on Kylo

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.770
Ren overseeing First Order construction.
Now if you look closely in that hangar,

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:57.600
you can see some original Empire AT-AT
walkers. That gives us a sense of scale

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.800
of this place. It is massive. Now I think
there's a very good chance this place is

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:06.570
The Supremacy - the new mega class star
destroyer and flagship of Supreme Leader

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:11.280
Snoke. It's wingspan is 60 kilometers.
Just for reference, The Inflictor, the

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:14.280
massive Star Destroyer that we saw
crash-landed on Jakku in The Force

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:19.650
Awakens was only 1.6 kilometers long.
So The Supremacy is the largest Star

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:22.590
Destroyer in any Star Wars movie. We
actually get a different look at it

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:31.800
later on. We also hear the voice of Snoke,
played by Andy Serkis. "When I found you, I saw raw, untamed power!"

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:35.399
Now despite Rian Johnson's initial
concerns, it seems like this trailer was

00:01:35.399 --> 00:01:38.880
edited in such a way to misdirect us, and I
think that's what could be happening

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:42.539
here. Now it seems like Snoke is talking
to Kylo here, but it's also possible he's

00:01:42.539 --> 00:01:46.979
