novelization, when Rey battled with Kylo

00:01:46.979 --> 00:01:51.179
and considered killing him off, Snoke reached
out to her and tried to recruit her. So,

00:01:51.179 --> 00:01:55.200
raw, untamed power definitely seems to
describe Rey in that moment. Okay next up

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:58.560
we get these awesome shots from this
battle on Crait with new First Order

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:03.060
walkers advancing. Once again, they used
an original empire AT-AT for scale here.

