00:02:39.329 --> 00:02:42.269
red soil. We actually saw those
resistance fighters in the teaser

00:02:42.269 --> 00:02:46.139
dragging up that dirt as well. And yeah, 
that is Kylo Ren's upsilon class command

00:02:46.139 --> 00:02:49.079
shuttle from The Force Awakens leading
