Of course Kylo's connection to his
grandfather is definitely a key motivator

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:13.860
to his character, so it's possible this
was intentional. Anyway, let's move on.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:20.100
"And beyond that... something truly special."

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:28.180
